<title>HONG KONG: Sui Chong said sale talks called off.</title>
<headline>Sui Chong said sale talks called off.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sui Chong Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday that Winfoong International Ltd and Hong Fok Corp Ltd had called off talks on selling their aggregate 74.5 percent stake in Sui Chong.</p>
<p>Sui Chong, a construction and civil engineering company, said Winfoong and Hong Fok had told it on Monday they had not been able to agree on terms for a sale of the stake.</p>
<p>Sui Chong shares were down HK$0.01 at HK$1.36 in late morning trade on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
